  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 406.01 Purpose. The purpose of this section is to establish the minimum continuing education requirements as provided by RSA 317-A:12, XI.\n\nSource. #5332, eff 4-1-92 (from Den 304.02), EXPIRED: 4-1-98\n\nNew. #6909, eff 12-9-98, EXPIRED: 12-9-06\n\nNew. #8838, eff 3-9-07; ss by #10794, eff 3-7-15; ss by #14398, eff 12-2-25, EXPIRES: 12-2-35 (formerly Den 403.01)",
